This version is for TI Nspire CX II and some CX. It will not work on TI Nspire CX HW-W.
(use https://www-fourier.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/~parisse/ti/khicas.zip instead).
There are two user interfaces for KhiCAS:
* the KhiCAS native interface, with a shell-like interface, full graph and programming
support and sessions compatible with Xcas and calculators where KhICAS is ported
(Numworks, Casio Prizm)
* the lua interface, fully integrated with TI nspire OS, with 2d input (cf README.khicaslua). Type * enter to run KhiCAS shell from the lua interface.

